   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]常见问题[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]咨询个性化瑜伽[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1e3aa8c23b5bd17f503a",
   "sourceHash": "1e3aa8c23b5bd17f503a53d0ef00e7525ff919d950018694ec660fce26a5a1f3",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]首页[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]全部治疗方案[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]瑜伽减压与活力重启方案[[CLOSE_5]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_056a5aa7460b55ddb78b",
   "sourceHash": "056a5aa7460b55ddb78bec47b1442782c9ecba6b49921e29c9b8f5a309eaef4b",
   "text": "Kairali 位于喀拉拉邦的瑜伽方案，在宁静的自然环境中结合个性化疗法、瑜伽与阿育吠陀护理。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2b06ea9aacc541239114",
   "sourceHash": "2b06ea9aacc5412391141aa2db73a475745b6a951850d9904df20053ec23cb76",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]瑜伽减压与活力重启方案[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7b4d8f9770b74d8e41fe",
   "sourceHash": "7b4d8f9770b74d8e41fe13afa65e33c5027c4397f465dbc4517a9c433f3e815a",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村的瑜伽减压与活力重启方案，将传统瑜伽技法与阿育吠陀治疗相结合。方案内容包括每日瑜伽练习（瑜伽休息术 Yoganidra、瑜伽体式、特别调息，以及根据体质和经验水平选择的净化法 kriyas 和手印 Mudras）、引导式冥想，以及 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Nasyam、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Thalapotichil 和 Navarakizhi 等阿育吠陀疗法。方案在喀拉拉邦宁静的环境中进行。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_40940b96314497296832",
   "sourceHash": "40940b963144972968326d8359d2f3cf30ae7ccf05b70129caf98f1a1c947504",
   "text": "我们的[[OPEN_1]]瑜伽减压与活力重启方案[[CLOSE_1]]理念",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fedaa267b06d30955cdd",
   "sourceHash": "fedaa267b06d30955cdd81925099b02195f4b4f89f55fcb9b2c84081d302a2a6",
   "text": "Kairali 的理念是将阿育吠陀实践与传统瑜伽相结合。方案从问诊开始，内容包括体能（dosha）评估、压力水平和精力状况。方案包括每日瑜伽体式、呼吸练习、冥想和引导式放松，并配合 Abhyanga（阿比扬加）和 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）等阿育吠陀治疗。私人瑜伽导师会根据患者的需要和经验水平制定瑜伽与冥想计划。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 患者 (patient) per language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e583669d14463ffc648b",
   "sourceHash": "e583669d14463ffc648bac99be41f22cbc09e13dd0a18821511a306552ab3272",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]瑜伽减压与活力重启方案[[CLOSE_1]]的流程",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cefb138ea4c8e1ff8ef7",
   "sourceHash": "cefb138ea4c8e1ff8ef7396537941200d107abe4216feefe11471b972e3b940c",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]依托经验丰富的阿育吠陀医生团队及 [[VAR_1]]+ 年的专业经验。[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4293cda1f455baa806aa",
   "sourceHash": "4293cda1f455baa806aae4ee7374a4586d60d7e8a3bc7b52e92d41c889a846c1",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]针对您的体质和体能（dosha）失衡接受个性化治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8008cff9e01aa8d52c9",
   "sourceHash": "c8008cff9e01aa8d52c99af1c1131303e41fbe7f46b691a8e654c6f0e1b506cd",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]在我们宁静的疗养环境中入住。我们的团队会根据需要提供随访、进展监测和治疗计划调整等支持。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db2f32ecb6e89a5434c9",
   "sourceHash": "db2f32ecb6e89a5434c98d6bf7e3a16d76abbde42770bf8d2f8c4d3301ee01a5",
   "text": "您的阿育吠陀瑜伽减压与活力重启方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1cc3d0c3788c0b23bb95",
   "sourceHash": "1cc3d0c3788c0b23bb95a2f3597af271a9617db3a9386e02924c69408c1d8d07",
   "text": "开始方案前，如何评估与压力相关的疲劳？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db3958f1a7a7550e5438",
   "sourceHash": "db3958f1a7a7550e5438f348d6081ac7b4123f39421adedd0e9c475326f03364",
   "text": "请与医生沟通您的睡眠、精力水平、日常压力以及任何已有诊断。这有助于厘清您的顾虑，并判断在开始方案前是否需要进一步评估。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_723a4900e08224825d6f",
   "sourceHash": "723a4900e08224825d6f3a96d897f23a5f799ca5aed9264b85353bd3e3b2f952",
   "text": "请告知您的病史、目前症状和目标，包括持续性疲劳、正在接受的任何心理健康治疗，以及您对身体活动的适应程度。这将有助于医生评估您是否适合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2896574b7e44ee754af6",
   "sourceHash": "2896574b7e44ee754af6f7b57cd40df40b4291380945ecda93e52f4175f3a7a8",
   "text": "瑜伽减压与活力重启方案 Prana Samya Yoga Chikitsa",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Programme name 'Prana Samya Yoga Chikitsa' kept in Latin form as a proper name."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e041d14b65112e00fdb",
   "sourceHash": "7e041d14b65112e00fdb73b4111ca78675a1d7db13c1352547a49c4f4a027f5f",
   "text": "瑜伽减压与活力重启 | Kairali Ayurveda",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_04788bfa92503596c707",
   "sourceHash": "04788bfa92503596c707675cbc0cb0d64feda180cd6680edd725079824662748",
   "text": "在玻璃墙环绕的瑜伽厅内，一位身穿白衣的 Kairali 瑜伽导师俯身指导一位坐着、身穿绿色库尔塔的来访者，窗外可见树木",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 来访者 (visitor) per language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a7c4e96cf2ac0946518",
   "sourceHash": "8a7c4e96cf2ac094651807c0d52edccaeb3bdf0bc95a08c54fcc77772d60d944",
   "text": "在瑜伽厅内，一位 Kairali 瑜伽导师扶稳一位身穿绿色库尔塔的患者的背部，她正在青绿色垫子上做后弯",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ffb001a7b0434d4ede4b",
   "sourceHash": "ffb001a7b0434d4ede4b203de810a9ef7dfa4ae9111a4f9c2e0dc8ea94bfbb5c",
   "text": "一位身穿绿色库尔塔的患者在 Kairali 瑜伽厅内的青绿色垫子上以树式保持平衡，双掌合十",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_84789d32469f268038ea",
   "sourceHash": "84789d32469f268038ea76537283759d5789586e46c3717d9c666b31f34b0088",
   "text": "一位身穿绿色库尔塔的患者沿着 Kairali 瑜伽厅带白色栏杆的走廊行走，身后是树木",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_344d7022b0f87b354656",
   "sourceHash": "344d7022b0f87b354656ee75195749c79308d22010af1e43e0988520ac4274df",
   "text": "：我们首先进行问诊，了解您的病史、症状和生活方式，并制定个人方案计划。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
